{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOLK HORROR COMEDY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's Weird Here</i> presents a tongue-in-cheek take on the folk horror genre, replete with blood, oddballs, and, of course, exposed flesh... Will YOU survive the weirdness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLASSIC SURVIVAL HORROR GAMEPLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the lunatics who seek your demise; navigate a labyrinthine landscape; solve puzzles; and, last but not least...manage your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RETRO-INSPIRED AESTHETICS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaudy border illustrations complement a minimalist, retro-inspired play space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832950?t=1751208976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832950?t=1751208976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832950/2e8bb04cab4bf83ba07906d2e6cf395519e42052/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751208976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832950/2e8bb04cab4bf83ba07906d2e6cf395519e42052/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751208976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"'It's Weird Here' is a game in the 'Folk Horror' genre; as such, it contains frequent depictions of ritualistic gore and (occasional) depictions of ritualistic sex. It is important to understand that this is NOT primarily a sex-themed game; instead, it is a horror game with occasional depictions of sexual acts. More info:\r\n\r\nFrequent depictions of violence, gore and torture. \r\nOccasional hard drug use. \r\nFrequent depictions of nudity and genitalia.\r\nOccasional depictions of uncensored sex and sexual acts between consenting adults. \r\nOccasional depictions of ritualistic suicide and ritualistic self-harm.\r\nStrong language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOLK HORROR COMEDY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's Weird Here</i> presents a tongue-in-cheek take on the folk horror genre, replete with blood, oddballs, and, of course, exposed flesh... Will YOU survive the weirdness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLASSIC SURVIVAL HORROR GAMEPLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the lunatics who seek your demise; navigate a labyrinthine landscape; solve puzzles; and, last but not least...manage your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RETRO-INSPIRED AESTHETICS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaudy border illustrations complement a minimalist, retro-inspired play space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Scary Pixels"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832950/c53dc5d7d467d673444f1f271c9b1859aac26b4d/header.jpg?t=1751208976","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832950/1779416255/e7c95718d1327bf3a50c4412fd9af7ced8cdfd6f/1751206346/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751208973","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832950/1779416255/e7c95718d1327bf3a50c4412fd9af7ced8cdfd6f/1751206346/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751208973","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3832950/1779416255/e7c95718d1327bf3a50c4412fd9af7ced8cdfd6f/1751206346/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751208973","id":257163102,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163102/m